@BookingService.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5283

### 1. Health check / Root endpoint
GET {{BookingService.Api_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Swagger OpenAPI Specification
GET {{BookingService.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

### 3. Ticket purchase endpoint (SP-05 / MVP-02)
POST {{BookingService.Api_HostAddress}}/events/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: aaaaaaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeeeeeeeeeee

{
  "fullName": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com"
}
